# Mugiwara mission evidence — regenerated by the browser suite, never committed.
# tests/e2e/shell.pw.ts creates this directory and writes the responsive
# screenshots on every run, so ignoring it keeps `git add -A` from pulling
# ~1.8 MB of binaries back into a diff.
.mugiwara/missions/*/evidence/
